    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234-a2">

                <pb facs="0356" n="268" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg268"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thormann to Mr.
                            Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Powell</hi>: At this moment, at 6 p.m., I
                    received a communication, a copy of which I inclose. The chief of the revolution
                    has given me forty-eight hours to move with my family to the capital, so I beg
                    you to give me all necessary help to effect it. I need at least two large boats,
                    one for the baggage and another for the family. Do try to do all you possibly
                    can so that during that time there shall be no shooting on either side.</p>
                <p>Your affectionate friend,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thormann.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
